              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "क्षणः (kṣaṇaḥ) — \"a moment\". एकः क्षणः — \"one moment\", said with a raised hand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "CDIAL 3642 connects kṣaṇa, \"the twinkling of an eye\", with akṣi, \"eye\": a moment is as long as a blink. It lives on as Hindi khan, \"moment\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
